  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0513.pamphile.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0513.pamphile.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0513.pamphile.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0513_pamphile"><head>ΠΑΜΦΙΛΗ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="i" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-i">
              <head>I.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-i-l1">Σπόγγος, λεκάνη, πτερόν, λεπαστὴ πάνυ πυκνή,</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-i-l2">ἣν ἐκπιοῦσ᾽ ἄκρατον ἀγαθοῦ δαίμονος</l>
                  <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-i-l3">τέττιξ κελαδεῖ.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Athenaeus XI p. 485 b.</bibl> de λεπαστῇ poculo agens: <quote>Θεόπομπος Παμφίλῃ Σπόγγος λεκάνη κτλ.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Vs. 1 et 2 libri λεπάστη πάνυ πυκνὴν ἐκπιοῦσ᾽. Correxit Schweighaeuserus. De pinnae usu vide supra p. 165. Ad vs. 2 respicit fortasse schol. Aristoph. Vesp. 523. V. Fragm. inc. fab. XX.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="ii" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-ii">
              <head>II.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-ii-l1">Λεπαστὴ μάλα συχνή,</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-ii-l2">ἣν ἐκπιοῦσ᾽ ἄκρατον ἀγαθοῦ δαίμονος</l>
                  <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-ii-l3">περιστατὸν βοῶσα τὴν κώμην ποιεῖ.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Athenaeus l. l. p. 485 e:</bibl>
                <quote>Θεόπομπος Παμφίλῃ Λεπαστὴ μάλα συχνή κτλ.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Vs. 1 et 2 vulgo λεπαστῇ μάλα συχνῇ ἦν, ἐκπιοῦσ᾽ etc. Correxit Schweighaeuserus, qui hos versus ex instaurata et nonnihil mutata eiusdem fabulae editione decerptos esse recte statuit. Vs. 3 Dindorfius περίστατον, Ibid. Α ποεῖ.</note>
            </div>
          <pb n="809" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.hxjhbd:scan:827" />
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="iii" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-iii">
              <head>III.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-iii-l1">Αὐτὴ δ᾽ ἐκείνη πρότερον ἐξηπίστατο</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-iii-l2">παρὰ τῆς ἐπιτηθῆς.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">Etymol. M. p. 366 11. Ἐπιτηθή: ἡ τῆς μητρὸς τηθή. Θεόπομπος Παμφίλῃ <quote>Αὐτὴ δ᾽ ἐκείνη κτλ.</quote>
              </note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="iv" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-iv">
              <head>IV.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-iv-l1">Τούτων ἁπάντων ὁ ῥαχιστὴς Δημοφῶν.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">Photius p. 484 4: ῥαχίζειν, τὸ ἀλαζονεύεσθαι, καὶ ὁ ῥαχιστὴς ὁ ἀλαζών· Θεόπομπος Παμφίλῃ <quote>Τούτων ἁπάντων κτλ.</quote> Eadem Suidas s. v. ῥαχίζειν.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="v" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0513-pamphile-v">
              <head>V.</head>
              <note type="source">Pollux X 49: Θεόπομπος ὁ κωμικὸς ἐν Παμφίλῃ καὶ <quote>σανδάλια</quote> εἴρηκεν, ἀλλ᾽ ἐπὶ γυναικός.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>